eText":"{n : Nat} → BitVec n → BitVec n → BitVec n","unsafe":false,"value":64,"source":{"code":"/--\nSubtracts one bitvector from another. This can be interpreted as either signed or unsigned subtraction\nmodulo `2^n`. Usually accessed via the `-` operator.\n\n-/\n@[expose]\nprotected def sub (x y : BitVec n) : BitVec n := .ofNat n ((2^n - y.toNat) + x.toNat)","start":45,"end":51},"axioms":[]}